<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Commerce Talks is a retail industry podcast, centered on the topic of empowering unified retail across verticals. This podcast is hosted by Teamwork Strategic Partnerships Manager Danny Di Nicolantonio.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Each week he welcomes a guest from Teamwork Commerce, our partner ecosystem or array of retail clients. These discussions are designed to explore these relationships, explain key elements of Teamwork Commerce, and educate retailers about the benefits that are accessible through Omnichannel retail.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Commerce Talks is available across all podcast platforms, as well as here on the blog section of the Teamwork Commerce Website. Listen to the podcast trailer below.</p>
